#: bot/handlers/personal/message.py:18
msgid "cmd-start"
msgstr ""
"🚀 Hello, {name}! I am your digital assistant for Telegram communities.\n"
"\n"
"With my help, you can:\n"
"🔹 Automate routine (moderation, greetings, templates)\n"
"🔹 Simplify communication (surveys, newsletters, chatbots)\n"
"🔹 Monitor activity (analytics, notifications, reports)\n"
"\n"
"Select a section:"

#: bot/handlers/personal/message.py:24
msgid "cmd-help"
msgstr ""
"🌟 Need assistance? Here’s how I can help!\n"
"\n"
"📌 Key Features:\n"
"⚙️ Automate Tasks: Set up auto-replies, moderation rules, or scheduled "
"posts.\n"
"📢 Audience Tools: Create polls, send broadcasts, or manage interactions.\n"
"📈 Get Reports: Track engagement, member growth, and content performance.\n"
"\n"
"🔧 Basic Commands:\n"
"\n"
"/start – Restart the bot or return to the main menu.\n"
"\n"
"/schedule – Plan posts in advance (e.g., /schedule 25.12.2024 15:00).\n"
"\n"
"/settings – Adjust automation rules or notification preferences.\n"
"\n"
"💡 Tips:\n"
"• Use buttons or quick replies to navigate faster.\n"
"• Need examples? Type /example [command] (e.g., /example schedule).\n"
"\n"
"🛠️ Stuck? Contact support: @YourSupportHandle | Visit Help Center.\n"
"\n"
"Reply with a command or tap a button below!"

